# 10. Current System Limitations

The current implementation is an analyst-controlled prototype.

The following capabilities are not yet fully implemented:

1. Continuous background alert collection.
2. Automatic incident correlation across different Rule IDs.
3. Automatic threat-intelligence enrichment.
4. A web-based SOC investigation dashboard.
5. Automated notifications.
6. Response automation.
7. Persistent incident lifecycle management.

The current collector runs when manually executed. The analyst also initiates the incident processor and AI analyzer manually.

